{"metadata":{"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WellTemperament"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"symbolKind":"property","title":"kirnbergerIII","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kirnbergerIII","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","text":"WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"extendedModule":"IvorTuning","externalID":"s:10IvorTuning0B6SystemPA2A15WellTemperamentVRszrlE13kirnbergerIIIAEvpZ::SYNTHESIZED::s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Property"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/kirnbergerIII","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Kirnberger III (Johann Philipp Kirnberger, 1779).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"kirnbergerIII"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WellTemperament","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Four fifths — C→G, G→D, D→A, and A→E — are each narrowed by ¼ of the syntonic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comma, equal to ⁴√5 ≈ 696.578 cents. One fifth — F♯→C♯ — is narrowed by one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schisma (32805:32768), equal to 16384:10935 ≈ 699.977 cents. The remaining seven"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fifths are pure (3:2). The circle closes exactly because one syntonic comma times"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one schisma equals one Pythagorean comma."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The four quarter-comma fifths make C–E a pure major third (5:4). Published in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Die Kunst des reinen Satzes in der Musik"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", Part II.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament\/kirnbergeriii"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/WellTemperament":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tuning system in which all twelve keys are usable but have distinct tonal characters,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"achieved by distributing the Pythagorean comma unevenly around the circle of fifths."}],"role":"symbol","title":"WellTemperament","url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning","title":"IvorTuning","url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning","abstract":[{"text":"Musical pitch, interval, and tuning system types.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/WellTemperament/kirnbergerIII":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/kirnbergerIII","title":"kirnbergerIII","role":"symbol","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"WellTemperament","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}]},"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"kirnbergerIII","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament\/kirnbergeriii","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Kirnberger III (Johann Philipp Kirnberger, 1779)."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}